# Copy to .env.local and fill in.
#
# For local development both values come from `pnpm exec supabase status`
# after `pnpm exec supabase start`. They are the same on every local install
# and only reach a database on 127.0.0.1. For a deployed environment take
# them from the Supabase dashboard (Project Settings -> API).
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ is correct on both of these. The publishable key is designed to
# be sent to the browser -- RLS is what gates it. CLAUDE.md's "never
# NEXT_PUBLIC_" rule is about the TMDB provider key, which is unrelated and
# arrives in phase 1a. Do not "fix" these; the browser client needs them.

NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
